  "content": {
    "id": "p24-q4",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "A rectangle has a perimeter of 126 cm. Calculate the breadth if the length is 0.3 m.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$33\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "$0.3\\text{ m}=30\\text{ cm}$.\n\nLet $b$ be the breadth in centimetres.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P&=2l+2b\\\\126&=2(30)+2b\\\\126&=60+2b\\\\66&=2b\\\\b&=33\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe breadth is $33\\text{ cm}$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
